{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "context": "observed", "date_basis": "source", "external_id": "s155", "external_status": "not_checked", "id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s155-yaml-3089cec4f6:c001:e002:86ef732b", "kind": "belief", "locator": "/turns/1/text", "metadata_hash": "c7d23cb1d07516e1ea178d16fdf4865f5376f85cfcad0501a2f62ff75529fa65", "published_at": "2024-11-11", "quote": "But guess what? In real estate, being too nice can cost you a big time.", "source_hash": "c885e707b391077ed00b9efea58012dd9bae4532c00187d920ecac89dd9914c8", "source_id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s155-yaml-3089cec4f6", "source_url": null, "speaker_id": "1", "statement": "Being too nice in real estate can be detrimental to success.", "time": "00:00:06", "title": "The Real Estate Secret No One Will Tell You", "topic": "client engagement", "topic_slug": "client-engagement", "unit_id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s155-yaml-3089cec4f6:u000002"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "context": "advised", "date_basis": "source", "external_id": "s155", "external_status": "not_checked", "id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s155-yaml-3089cec4f6:c001:e003:7cf30cd0", "kind": "advice", "locator": "/turns/1/text", "metadata_hash": "c7d23cb1d07516e1ea178d16fdf4865f5376f85cfcad0501a2f62ff75529fa65", "published_at": "2024-11-11", "quote": "You have to dig deep and find out what the client's actual situation is and what problems they are trying to solve with the real estate.", "source_hash": "c885e707b391077ed00b9efea58012dd9bae4532c00187d920ecac89dd9914c8", "source_id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s155-yaml-3089cec4f6", "source_url": null, "speaker_id": "1", "statement": "It is crucial to understand the client's actual situation and problems they're trying to solve.", "time": "00:00:06", "title": "The Real Estate Secret No One Will Tell You", "topic": "client engagement", "topic_slug": "client-engagement", "unit_id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s155-yaml-3089cec4f6:u000002"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "context": "hypothetical", "date_basis": "source", "external_id": "s155", "external_status": "not_checked", "id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s155-yaml-3089cec4f6:c001:e004:1d729f53", "kind": "self_report", "locator": "/turns/1/text", "metadata_hash": "c7d23cb1d07516e1ea178d16fdf4865f5376f85cfcad0501a2f62ff75529fa65", "published_at": "2024-11-11", "quote": "When you're walking into the doctor's appointment and there is a nice doctor in a, you know, full gear medical person, how will you yourself determine if he is a professional or someone who is just graduated from the medical school?", "source_hash": "c885e707b391077ed00b9efea58012dd9bae4532c00187d920ecac89dd9914c8", "source_id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s155-yaml-3089cec4f6", "source_url": null, "speaker_id": "1", "statement": "How one discerns professionalism in a doctor can be analogous to recognizing credibility in real estate agents.", "time": "00:00:06", "title": "The Real Estate Secret No One Will Tell You", "topic": "professional background", "topic_slug": "professional-background", "unit_id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s155-yaml-3089cec4f6:u000002"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "context": "hypothetical", "date_basis": "source", "external_id": "s155", "external_status": "not_checked", "id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s155-yaml-3089cec4f6:c001:e005:4b15bc75", "kind": "self_report", "locator": "/turns/2/text", "metadata_hash": "c7d23cb1d07516e1ea178d16fdf4865f5376f85cfcad0501a2f62ff75529fa65", "published_at": "2024-11-11", "quote": "If the person starts to jump up and down, I'm the best doctor and I can absolutely cure you. Will you actually believe him?", "source_hash": "c885e707b391077ed00b9efea58012dd9bae4532c00187d920ecac89dd9914c8", "source_id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s155-yaml-3089cec4f6", "source_url": null, "speaker_id": "1", "statement": "Clients are less likely to believe an overly boastful sales pitch compared to one that provokes deeper reflection on their needs.", "time": "00:00:36", "title": "The Real Estate Secret No One Will Tell You", "topic": "client engagement", "topic_slug": "client-engagement", "unit_id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s155-yaml-3089cec4f6:u000003"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "context": "observed", "date_basis": "source", "external_id": "s155", "external_status": "not_checked", "id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s155-yaml-3089cec4f6:c001:e006:2e12b70e", "kind": "observed_behavior", "locator": "/turns/3/text", "metadata_hash": "c7d23cb1d07516e1ea178d16fdf4865f5376f85cfcad0501a2f62ff75529fa65", "published_at": "2024-11-11", "quote": "the doctor who is asking you questions sometimes might be not very polite, he helping you realize that the problem is way bigger than you expected.", "source_hash": "c885e707b391077ed00b9efea58012dd9bae4532c00187d920ecac89dd9914c8", "source_id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s155-yaml-3089cec4f6", "source_url": null, "speaker_id": "1", "statement": "A doctor who asks probing questions, even if less polite, helps patients recognize underlying issues.", "time": "00:00:47", "title": "The Real Estate Secret No One Will Tell You", "topic": "client engagement", "topic_slug": "client-engagement", "unit_id": "youtube-shorts-run-transcripts-s155-yaml-3089cec4f6:u000004"}
